# ── Python backend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
python_backend/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ── Dataset ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# p000003.mat (57 MB) IS tracked so the project runs from a fresh clone.
# The .zip is just a redundant copy of the same recording — not tracked.
dataset/*.zip

# ── Large source art not needed to build/run ──────────────────────────────────
# The Unity twin has its own copy at unity/CardiacDigitalTwin/Assets/Models/,
# which IS tracked. These are the originals + React-only assets.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "models/" would also ignore the
# backend's python_backend/models/ package (it silently did, once).
/models/
/images/
public/Heart.fbx
public/beating-heart.glb
image.png

# Unity generated folders are ignored by unity/CardiacDigitalTwin/.gitignore
